#. ja: 漆黒の冒険録
#. de: Ausgabe[p] von „Abenteuergeschichten: Shadowbringers“
#. fr: exemplaire des “Contes d'aventures<nbsp>: Chroniques des Ténèbres”
#. column 2: copies of <i>Tales of Adventure: Shadowbringers</i>
#. column 8: A detailed record of travels through the realm and beyond─so detailed, in fact, that all who read it come to swear they experienced the events firsthand.<br><br>Use to instantly complete all main scenario quests up through “Death Unto Dawn.” Cannot be used outside large settlements. Can be used for any Disciple of War or Magic, excluding limited jobs. Automatic logout will commence upon usage.
#. column 9: Tales of Adventure: Shadowbringers
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "Item:34062:0:0"
msgid "copy of <i>Tales of Adventure: Shadowbringers</i>"
msgstr ""

#. de: Ausgaben[p] von „Abenteuergeschichten: Shadowbringers“
#. fr: exemplaires des “Contes d'aventures<nbsp>: Chroniques des Ténèbres”
#. column 0: copy of <i>Tales of Adventure: Shadowbringers</i>
#. column 8: A detailed record of travels through the realm and beyond─so detailed, in fact, that all who read it come to swear they experienced the events firsthand.<br><br>Use to instantly complete all main scenario quests up through “Death Unto Dawn.” Cannot be used outside large settlements. Can be used for any Disciple of War or Magic, excluding limited jobs. Automatic logout will commence upon usage.
#. column 9: Tales of Adventure: Shadowbringers
#. macro: <i> — italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </i> — end of: italic text (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "Item:34062:0:2"
msgid "copies of <i>Tales of Adventure: Shadowbringers</i>"
msgstr ""

#. ja: 覚えていると誓った冒険の記録。<br>メインクエスト『黎明の死闘』までをコンプリートする<br>[都市でのみ使用可能]<br>[リミテッドジョブを除くファイター、またはソーサラーでのみ使用可能]<br>[使用後、自動的にログアウトする]
#. de: Eine detaillierte Aufzeichnung der jüngeren Geschichte Hydaelyns und des ersten Splitters<nbsp>- so detailliert, dass der Leser glaubt, die geschilderten Ereignisse selbst erlebt zu haben.<br><br>Benutze das Buch, um das Hauptszenario bis einschließlich des Auftrags „Kampf im Morgengrauen“ abzuschließen. (Kann nicht außerhalb großer Städte verwendet werden. Kann von allen Krieger- oder Magierklassen benutzt werden, die kein beschränkter Job sind. Nach der Benutzung wirst du automatisch ausgeloggt.)
#. fr: Un recueil d'aventures ayant eu lieu dans le premier reflet.<br>Permet de terminer l'épopée jusqu'à la quête “Aube meurtrière”.<br>[Utilisable dans les cités uniquement]<br>[Utilisable uniquement par les combattants et les mages (sauf jobs restreints)]<br>[Déconnexion automatique après utilisation]
#. column 0: copy of <i>Tales of Adventure: Shadowbringers</i>
#. column 2: copies of <i>Tales of Adventure: Shadowbringers</i>
#. column 9: Tales of Adventure: Shadowbringers
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "Item:34062:0:8"
msgid "A detailed record of travels through the realm and beyond─so detailed, in fact, that all who read it come to swear they experienced the events firsthand.<br><br>Use to instantly complete all main scenario quests up through “Death Unto Dawn.” Cannot be used outside large settlements. Can be used for any Disciple of War or Magic, excluding limited jobs. Automatic logout will commence upon usage."
msgstr ""

